## 2. Workspace Management (Orgs & Projects)

### A. Create an Organization
Creates a new isolated workspace. The creator automatically becomes the `admin`. The system will auto-generate a unique `code` (e.g., ORG-A1B2C3).

**Request:** `POST /api/organizations/`
```json
{
  "name": "Ministry of Transport",
  "description": "National agency responsible for transportation.",
  "contact_email": "hello@mot.gov.zw",
  "phone_number": "+263 242 123456",
  "address": "Kaguvi Building, Central Ave, Harare"
}
```
*(Note: Only `name` is required. The rest are optional.)*

### B. Create a Project
Creates a project under an organization. The creator automatically becomes the `manager`. The system will auto-generate a unique `code` (e.g., PROJ-X9Y8Z7).

**Request:** `POST /api/projects/`
```json
{
  "name": "Harare Road Maintenance",
  "organization": "<uuid_of_organization>"
}
```

### C. Fetch Projects
Retrieve all projects the logged-in user has access to across all organizations.

**Request:** `GET /api/projects/`

