## 3. Team Member Invitations
You can assign existing users to your Organizations or Projects.
*Note: If you submit a username that does not exist, the API will return a `400 Bad Request`. The user must register first.*

### A. Invite to Organization (Requires `admin` role)
**Request:** `POST /api/organizations/<org_uuid>/members/`
```json
{
  "username": "field_officer_john",
  "role": "member" 
}
```
*(Roles: `admin`, `member`)*

### B. Invite to Project (Requires `manager` or `admin` role)
**Request:** `POST /api/projects/<project_uuid>/members/`
```json
{
  "username": "field_officer_john",
  "role": "collector" 
}
```
*(Roles: `manager`, `collector`)*

